| Feature | `Runnable` | `Callable` |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Usage** | Used with `Thread` or `ExecutorService`. | Used with `ExecutorService` to submit tasks. |
| **Definition** | Interface to define a task for threads. | Interface to define tasks with results. |
| **Exception Handling** | Cannot throw checked exceptions. | Can throw checked exceptions. |
